.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::QuartzPrecipitation\fP< dim >::Calculate ()\fR [virtual]\fP"
Calculating how much quartz gets precipitated

.PP
.IP "1." 4
calculate quartz solubility at the nodes (done in \fBQuartzSolubility\&.h\fP)
.IP "2." 4
get vector properties flux and solubility gradient in the element
.IP "3." 4
project solubility gradient on fluid flux
.IP "4." 4
compute product of mass flux, projected solubility gradient, and time\&. This product gives the amount of quartz that is dissolved or precipitated 
.PP

